# Never commit camera originals — they carry GPS, timestamps, and device info.
# Strip a photo before adding it, and commit only the output:
#   magick IN.jpg -auto-orient -resize 2000x2000\> -colorspace sRGB -strip -quality 82 gallery/NAME.jpg
# (-auto-orient is required: -strip drops the EXIF tag that keeps the photo upright.)
IMG_*.jpg
IMG_*.JPG
IMG_*.jpeg
IMG_*.heic
IMG_*.HEIC
IMG_*.png
IMG_*.PNG

.DS_Store
